.\"                                      Hey, EMACS: -*- nroff -*-
.TH DESMUME 1 "November 21, 2026" "2.7.10"
.\" Manual page for the GTK4 frontend of DeSmuME.
.SH NAME
desmume \- Nintendo DS emulator (GTK4 frontend)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B desmume
.RI [ options ] " files" ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBdesmume\fP is a Nintendo DS emulator that runs homebrew demos and commercial
games. This manual page documents the GTK4 frontend, which uses a native GTK 4
interface (version 4.10 or newer), GPU-accelerated presentation via GSK and
optional GPU image filters through WebGPU.
.PP
The GTK4 frontend shares its core, save files and configuration keys with the
GTK3 frontend. Only one GTK frontend is built per Meson configuration; select
it with \fB\-Dfrontend\-gtk\fP.
.SH OPTIONS
These programs follow the usual GNU command line syntax, with long
options starting with two dashes (`-').
A summary of options is included below.
.TP
.B \-\-load-slot=NUM
Loads savegame from slot NUM.
.TP
.B \-\-disable-sound
Disables the sound emulation.
.TP
.B \-\-disable-limiter
Disables the 60 fps limiter.
.TP
.B \-\-save-type=TYPE
Select savetype (0 = autodetect, 1 = EEPROM 4kbit, 2 = EEPROM 64kbit,
3 = EEPROM 512kbit, 4 = FRAM 256kbit, 5 = FLASH 2mbit, 6 = FLASH 4kbit).
.TP
.B \-\-fwlang=LANG
Set the firmware language (0 = Japanese, 1 = English, 2 = French,
3 = German, 4 = Italian, 5 = Spanish).
.TP
.B \-\-cflash=PATH_TO_DISK_IMAGE
Enable disk image GBAMP compact flash emulation.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show summary of options.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version of program.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DESMUME_GTK4_TEST_FRAME
When set, the display is fed a synthetic test frame instead of a ROM. Useful
for smoke-testing the rendering path without game data.
.TP
.B DESMUME_GTK4_TIMING
When set to \fB1\fP, presentation timing is printed to stderr every 120 frames
(mean / p50 / p95 / max for texture upload and GSK snapshot). Off by default.
.TP
.B GDK_BACKEND
Selects the GDK backend, for example \fBx11\fP or \fBwayland\fP.
.SH INPUT
The mouse cursor acts as the stylus; a mouse click replaces a stylus touch.
.PP
Keyboard mapping (defaults, user-configurable):
.RS
F1\-F10 load savegame from slot 1\-10
.RE
.RS
Shift+F1\-F10 save game to slot 1\-10
.RE
.RS
Arrow keys act as the d\-pad
.RE
.RS
z = A, x = B, a = Y, s = X, q = L, w = R
.RE
.RS
Enter = START, Left Shift = SELECT, Backspace = LID
.RE
.SH FILES
Configuration is stored in the user config directory and is shared with the
other DeSmuME frontends. GPU filter choice (View menu) is persisted there.
.SH AUTHOR
desmume was written by the DeSmuME team
(https://github.com/TASVideos/desmume).
.PP
This manual page documents the GTK4 frontend and may be used by others.
